Comment:
 Binary package built from a PyInstaller bundle. Files paths are relative to
 /opt/vinyl-label-printer. The bundle contains third-party components; their
 verbatim licence texts are installed next to this file:
   third-party/python/<distribution>-<version>/   licence files of the bundled
                                                  Python distributions
   third-party/debian/<package>.copyright         Debian copyright files of
                                                  the bundled Ubuntu 22.04
                                                  libraries
 build_deb.sh fails if the bundle contains a Debian package or Python
 distribution that is not named below (first word of an indented line).
 .
 Source code: the application at https://github.com/EJAIS/vinylsticker; the
 bundled Ubuntu libraries via "apt-get source <package>" (Ubuntu 22.04);
 Python distributions on https://pypi.org; Qt 6 at https://download.qt.io.

